Package: desktop-studio
Version: 1.0.0
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Desktop Studio contributors <desktop-studio@localhost>
Depends: python3 (>= 3.10), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0 (>= 4.12), gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), gir1.2-gdkpixbuf-2.0, librsvg2-common
Recommends: gnome-control-center, wireplumber
Description: Native GNOME desktop configuration studio
 Configure appearance, dock, shortcuts, windows, workspaces, and more.
 Includes a dynamic GSettings browser, reviewed profiles, backups, and undo.
